############################################################
# ALERT 2: MountMissing - unmount the share
############################################################

    The availability alert. It uses absent() rather than a threshold,
    because node_exporter stops publishing node_filesystem_* for a
    mountpoint the moment it disappears - the series ceases to exist
    rather than going to zero, so there is no value left to compare.

    before:
      /dev/loop2 /mnt/xfs xfs

    unmounting /mnt/xfs ...
